{"ID":"20240515143622-aw9fghc","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240515143622-aw9fghc","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515143622-aw9fghc\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515143950-pw5rrkc\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515143950-pw5rrkc\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515143950-pw5rrkc\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:625,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:625\u0026#125;","title":"114","type":"doc","updated":"20240515185327"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240515143950-pw5rrkc","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 984px;","id":"20240515143950-pw5rrkc","updated":"20240515185327"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期：2008/08/12"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Zhao Zhi-Hong"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"女"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"46歲，中等身材，偏瘦。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/08/25"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"初診以憂鬱症為主訴來診，師診斷為真寒假熱，予四逆湯加減。二診時自言足較溫，仍有頭痛、噯氣。惡寒，時頭暈，帶脈痛。今日三診自言帶脈痛已去，月經過後有白帶。本次四診時主述頭痛仍有，偶爾心痛、左脇下刺痛、呼吸仍短氣，胃口仍不佳，不吃即餓，一吃又脹，劍突下一按即噯氣，近二日一醒來。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（1）頭痛：仍有，雙太陽穴痛，左側較重。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）胃口：不太好，時有噯氣，不吃即餓，一吃又脹。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（3）呼吸：短氣，吸入困難。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（4）腰痛：較上次改善，但仍有。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（5）心痛：偶爾有。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（6）脇痛：左肋下時刺痛。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（7）暈眩：較上次改善，但仍有。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（8）手足：手足涼，額溫。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（9）口渴：有一點渴，但不喜歡喝水。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（10）睡眠：近二天來醒後不易入睡，心煩。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（11）大便：一日一次，時有綠色糞，不消化食物多。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（12）情緒：易怒"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（13）其他：心下一按就噯氣(心下痞)"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脈緩無力"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"無"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淡黃紅，稍乾。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"耳診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"無。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"裏陽虛仍有。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"針灸處方："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"無。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生附子二錢(布包)，乾薑二錢、炙甘草三錢"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"桂枝三錢、旋覆花二錢、代赭石三錢"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"川芎三錢、白芍六錢、柴胡三錢、鬱金五錢、黃芩三錢、枳實三錢"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"遠志三錢、龍骨三錢、熟地三錢、當歸二錢 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10帖   "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9碗水煮成3碗   "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"早晚飯前各喝一碗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脈緩重按無力，屬陽虛，如四肢水腫用生硫黃，無水腫用生附。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"川芎治其頭痛，枳實治其心痛，旋覆花代赭石治其噯氣，師云左脇下刺痛與其噯氣有關。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]}]}]}